  "source_discrepancy": "At plus 90 degrees Table I gives 0.0060(70); the main prose gives 0.0070 +/- 0.0060. The analysis consistently uses Table I for the 12-row comparison.",
  "authors_distance_definition": "One half the sum of absolute differences between measured and theoretical position probabilities (total variation). The distance and its error are transcribed; they use the same records and are not added to the inconclusive-frequency residuals.",
